  "title": "Roasted Loin of Pork with Pan Gravy",
  "description": "Make an easy pork gravy with pan drippings and stock, then ladle it over slices of deliciously seasoned roasted pork loin for a flavor-packed main dish.",
  "authors": [
    "France Cevallos"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-12-04T06:32:09-05:00",
